e.ts</code>](file:///Users/avishjain/avishjain9-repos/33-codealchemist/mediavault%202/src/lib/mediavault-store.ts#L64-L120)</td><td>Zustand store with local persistence (<code>STORAGE_KEY_FILES</code>), simulating multi-stage encryption, file integrity verification, and activity logging.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tamper Analysis &amp; EXIF</strong></td><td>[<code>camara-temper/src/lib/fileAnalyzer.ts</code>](file:///Users/avishjain/avishjain9-repos/33-codealchemist/camara-temper/src/lib/fileAnalyzer.ts#L66-L179)</td><td>Forensic file analyzer combining Web Crypto SHA-256 (<code>crypto.subtle.digest</code>) with <code>exifr</code> parsing to detect editing software signatures (<code>photoshop</code>, <code>gimp</code>, <code>lightroom</code>).</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Edge Function Invocations</strong></td><td>[<code>truthlence/src/pages/Index.tsx</code>](file:///Users/avishjain/avishjain9-repos/33-codealchemist/truthlence/src/pages/Index.tsx#L35-L38) &amp; [<code>calldetection-sms-contentdetection/src/pages/CallDetection.tsx</code>](file:///Users/avishjain/avishjain9-repos/33-codealchemist/calldetection-sms-contentdetection/src/pages/CallDetection.tsx#L23-L26)</td><td>Remote serverless AI invocations via <code>supabase.functions.invoke(&#39;analyze-media&#39;)</code> and <code>supabase.functions.invoke(&#39;analyze-content&#39;)</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Authentication &amp; RBAC</strong></td><td>[<code>mainpage/src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx</code>](file:///Users/avishjain/avishjain9-repos/33-codealchemist/mainpage/src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx#L68-L99)</td><td>Supabase Auth listener (<code>onAuthStateChange</code>) mapped to relational <code>profiles</code> table with role definitions (<code>Journalist</code>, <code>Analyst</code>, <code>Admin</code>).</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="_3-how-the-documentation-adapts" tabindex="-1">3. How the Documentation Adapts <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-how-the-documentation-adapts" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;